  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.33\n- Initial package. Uno aggregate integration delegating to AppCheck.Browser, AppCheck.Android, AppCheck.Apple and AppCheck.Windows per head; provider selection uses per-platform aggregate enums (AndroidProvider / AppleProvider / BrowserProvider properties) mapped to the delegate packages' provider enums with the debug-first default (one shared composition, no consumer #if platform checks); forwards reCAPTCHA v3/Enterprise selection and SiteKey on the WebAssembly head and fails fast on the Skia desktop head.",
